---
const sections = [
  {en:'Health',es:'Salud',icon:'♡',slug:'health'},
  {en:'Nutrition',es:'Alimentación',icon:'♧',slug:'nutrition'},
  {en:'Training',es:'Educación',icon:'✦',slug:'training'},
  {en:'Puppies',es:'Cachorros',icon:'♧',slug:'puppies'}
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><link rel="icon" href="https://www.bulldogfrances.com.ar/favicon.ico" type="image/x-icon"><title>BulldogFrances.com | French Bulldog · Bulldog Francés</title>
<meta name="description" content="A bilingual French Bulldog editorial portal. Un portal bilingüe dedicado al bulldog francés.">
<style>
:root{font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;color:#1f302a;background:#fff}*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0}a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}button{font:inherit}
.top{height:74px;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;position:relative;z-index:2;background:#fff}.brand{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:center;text-align:center;gap:3px;font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:clamp(11px,2.1vw,22px);font-weight:bold;white-space:nowrap}.brand small{font:9px Arial;letter-spacing:2px;font-weight:400}.brand:first-child{padding-right:50px}.brand:nth-child(2){padding-left:50px}.mobile-domain{display:none}.dog{position:absolute;top:24px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%);font-size:clamp(66px,13vw,132px);line-height:1;filter:drop-shadow(0 4px 4px #0003);pointer-events:none;z-index:5}
.split{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr) minmax(0,1fr)}.half{min-width:0;padding:78px clamp(12px,4vw,70px) 24px}.en{background:linear-gradient(155deg,#244a3b,#0d2820);color:#fff}.es{background:linear-gradient(155deg,#f2e7d6,#dfcbb3);color:#352318}.eyebrow{font-size:clamp(8px,1.3vw,12px);letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase}.hero h1{font:700 clamp(24px,5.5vw,76px)/.98 Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:15px 0}.hero p{font-size:clamp(12px,1.7vw,19px);line-height:1.5;max-width:460px}.search{display:flex;background:#fff;border-radius:99px;margin:26px 0 22px;padding:5px;gap:4px}.search input{width:100%;min-width:0;border:0;background:transparent;padding:8px;color:#182d24;outline-offset:4px}.search button{border:0;border-radius:99px;background:#346b55;color:#fff;padding:10px 16px;cursor:pointer}.es .search button{background:#8e6e4e}.cats{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}.cats a{text-align:center;font-size:clamp(9px,1.25vw,15px);padding:8px 1px;border-radius:8px}.cats a:hover,.cats a:focus-visible{outline:2px solid currentColor}.cats span{display:block;font-size:clamp(21px,3vw,33px);margin-bottom:7px}
.feature{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1.2fr;gap:12px;align-items:center;padding:20px clamp(12px,4vw,70px);min-height:210px}.feature.en{background:#e4ece5;color:#18392e}.feature.es{background:#f5ede1;color:#3b291c}.photo{border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#a7c8a4,#557960);height:150px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-size:75px}.es .photo{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#e5caa5,#b99874)}.feature h2{font:700 clamp(16px,2.2vw,29px)/1.08 Georgia,serif;margin:8px 0}.feature p{font-size:clamp(10px,1.3vw,15px);line-height:1.4}.feature a{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(11px,1.3vw,15px)}
.foot{padding:25px clamp(8px,3vw,45px) 30px;text-align:center}.foot strong{font:700 clamp(11px,2vw,19px) Georgia,serif}.foot p{font-size:12px}.foot nav{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:center;gap:10px;margin-top:22px}.foot nav a{font-size:clamp(10px,1vw,13px);text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px}
@media(max-width:550px){.top{height:104px;grid-template-rows:46px 58px}.mobile-domain{display:block;grid-column:1/-1;grid-row:1;text-align:center;align-self:center;font:700 clamp(16px,4.4vw,23px) Georgia,serif;letter-spacing:-.02em}.brand{grid-row:2;font-size:0}.brand:first-child{padding-right:30px}.brand:nth-child(3){padding-left:30px}.brand small{font-size:clamp(9px,2.5vw,12px);letter-spacing:.4px;font-weight:500}.dog{top:56px;font-size:74px}.half{padding:63px 10px 15px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(23px,6.3vw,35px);min-height:90px}.hero p{font-size:11px;min-height:68px}.eyebrow{font-size:8px;letter-spacing:1px}.search{margin:12px 0}.search input{font-size:10px;padding:6px;width:0;flex:1}.search button{padding:8px;font-size:10px}.cats{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}.cats a{font-size:11px}.cats span{font-size:23px}.feature{padding:12px 9px;display:block}.photo{height:90px;font-size:48px}.feature h2{font-size:18px}.feature p{font-size:11px}.foot{padding:18px 7px}.foot p{font-size:10px}.foot nav{gap:8px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="top"><div class="mobile-domain">BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</div><a class="brand" href="/en/">BULLDOGFRANCES.COM<small>THE FRENCH BULLDOG</small></a><a class="brand" href="/es/">BULLDOGFRANCES.COM<small>EL BULLDOG FRANCÉS</small></a><div class="dog" aria-hidden="true">🐶</div></header>
<main>
<div class="split hero">
<section class="half en" lang="en"><div class="eyebrow">The French Bulldog</div><h1>Small dog.<br>Big personality.</h1><p>Thoughtful guides and practical information for a healthier, happier French Bulldog.</p><form class="search" action="/en/" method="get"><input aria-label="Search in English" name="q" placeholder="Search guides…" /><button>Search</button></form><nav class="cats" aria-label="English categories">{sections.map(s=><a href={'/en/'+s.slug+'/'}><span aria-hidden="true">{s.icon}</span>{s.en}</a>)}</nav></section>
<section class="half es" lang="es"><div class="eyebrow">El Bulldog Francés</div><h1>Pequeño perro.<br>Gran carácter.</h1><p>Guías rigurosas e información práctica para cuidar mejor a tu bulldog francés.</p><form class="search" action="/es/" method="get"><input aria-label="Buscar en español" name="q" placeholder="Buscar guías…" /><button>Buscar</button></form><nav class="cats" aria-label="Categorías en español">{sections.map(s=><a href={'/es/'+s.slug+'/'}><span aria-hidden="true">{s.icon}</span>{s.es}</a>)}</nav></section>
</div>
<div class="split">
<article class="feature en" lang="en"><div class="photo" aria-hidden="true">🐕</div><div><div class="eyebrow">Featured guide</div><h2>French Bulldog health essentials</h2><p>Care, breathing and everyday wellbeing.</p><a href="/en/health/">Explore health →</a></div></article>
<article class="feature es" lang="es"><div class="photo" aria-hidden="true">🐕</div><div><div class="eyebrow">Guía destacada</div><h2>Cuidados esenciales del bulldog francés</h2><p>Salud, respiración y bienestar diario.</p><a href="/es/health/">Explorar salud →</a></div></article>
</div>
</main>
<footer class="split"><div class="foot en" lang="en"><strong>BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</strong><p>Knowledge · Care · Community</p><nav aria-label="English legal and site links"><a href="/en/">Home</a><a href="/en/about/">About</a><a href="/en/directory/">Directory</a><a href="/en/affiliate-disclosure/">Affiliate Disclosure</a><a href="/en/privacy/">Privacy</a><a href="/en/terms/">Terms</a></nav></div><div class="foot es" lang="es"><strong>BULLDOGFRANCES.COM</strong><p>Conocimiento · Cuidado · Comunidad</p><nav aria-label="Enlaces legales y del sitio"><a href="/es/">Inicio</a><a href="/es/about/">Acerca de</a><a href="/es/directory/">Directorio</a><a href="/es/affiliate-disclosure/">Aviso de afiliación</a><a href="/es/privacy/">Privacidad</a><a href="/es/terms/">Términos</a></nav></div></footer>
</body></html>